<title>USA: SyQuest ends effort to acquire Nomai.</title>
<headline>SyQuest ends effort to acquire Nomai.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc said on Monday it has ended efforts to acquire Nomai SA, a French manufacturer of removable computer hard drives and cartridges.</p>
<p>In a statement, SyQuest said Nomai attempted to alter the terms of the deal. SyQuest, which had previously obtained a court judgment against Nomai for infringement of intellectual property rights, said it will take aggressive legal action to protect its property rights and enforce claims against Nomai.</p>
</text>
